 "earlier_is": "Versions of these files that commits in this repository hold and the tip does not. A picture replaced rather than deleted keeps its name and leaves its bytes in the history, published to everybody who clones this, and until the QA round of September 2026 nothing compared them with anything: twenty such blobs were in here, two of them in commits already pushed. Every one was looked at then, and each is a screenshot of the demo or a sheet this repository prints from its own files — 19-status.png in each generation lists the archives the instance held, and both list Vera Lindqvist, Anders Lindqvist and Zoya Kravets and nobody else. From here on this list is written by docs/take-the-pictures.py and tools/make-one-pager.py as they displace a version, and tools/nothing-of-yours.py refuses any version that is in neither list."
}
